      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HERE COMES JOJO (8) tends to take a while to wind up, missing the placings two back but running on to last time finishing second (26.07) in a Grade 5 at Warragul. Form at the trip sound including four wins. One of the leading chances. ESCAPING BINDI (2) stalked the lead after a clean break from the tricky draw and went on to finish third (25.65) at Ballarat in a Grade 5 over 450m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Expected to be in this for a long way. DR. LOUIS (1) has a solid strike rate from this box.",
